CONVERT SINGLE OR DOUBLE LINKED LIST TO BST in place:
Using the reverse of inorder traversal operate in sets of 3 nodes from the linked list.
...
the idea is to take sets of 3 nodes and form left-parent-right combinations. after you do the right node
you have two options:
-> add next node as parent to center OR
-> as right node to the current right node

Hint: use current height to decide this. For example if current height is 4 add next 3 elements to the right most 
node before adding a parent to the current center.


